    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Fix ABSN.start()'s 'duration' parameter description]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42282</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42282"/>
        <updated>2025-12-09T01:18:22.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7843391?u=9efe83d5b512e6fc0848eee0337664922da2311d&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Fixes the description of the AudioBufferSourceNode <code class="notranslate">start()</code>'s <code class="notranslate">duration</code> parameter so it's not said to be similar to calling <code class="notranslate">stop(duration)</code>.</p>

<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Since this specs change <a href="https://github.com/WebAudio/web-audio-api/pull/1681" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/WebAudio/web-audio-api/pull/1681/hovercard">1</a> (in 2018) the <code class="notranslate">duration</code> argument is specced <a href="https://webaudio.github.io/web-audio-api/#dom-audiobuffersourcenode-start-when-offset-duration-duration" rel="nofollow">2</a> as being the duration of the buffer's content to be played, and not necessarily the one of the AudioContext's clock. So if the source node has a <code class="notranslate">playbackRate</code> that is not <code class="notranslate">1</code>, using this parameter will not be the same as using <code class="notranslate">stop(duration)</code>.</p>

<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">I based the wordings on the specs text, but I don't mind another formulation altogether.</p>
<p dir="auto">Might also be noted that there is an interop issue here, where only Firefox does follow the specs. I'll open issues to get this sorted out though.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="334611177" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/WebAudio/web-audio-api/issues/1681" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/WebAudio/web-audio-api/pull/1681/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WebAudio/web-audio-api/pull/1681">WebAudio/web-audio-api#1681</a></li>
<li><a href="https://webaudio.github.io/web-audio-api/#dom-audiobuffersourcenode-start-when-offset-duration-duration" rel="nofollow">https://webaudio.github.io/web-audio-api/#dom-audiobuffersourcenode-start-when-offset-duration-duration</a></li>
</ul>

<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto">N/A</p>



]]></content>
        <author>
            <name>Kaiido</name>
            <email>Kaiido@noreply.github.com</email>
            <uri>https://github.com/Kaiido</uri>
        </author>
        <published>2025-12-08T08:07:47.000Z</published>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[fix: not mark required aria attributes as required]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42276</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42276"/>
        <updated>2025-12-07T15:27:30.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83744975?u=2ad0feaa0569c5bde842b07ada630a9f10eab41f&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">unmarked not required aria attributes as required.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">Because <code class="notranslate">aria-selected</code> for <code class="notranslate">option</code> role and <code class="notranslate">aria-valuenow</code> for <code class="notranslate">spinbutton</code> role are not required and both roles have default values for their attributes.</p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#spinbutton" rel="nofollow">https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#spinbutton</a></p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">Authors SHOULD set the <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#aria-valuenow" rel="nofollow">aria-valuenow</a> attribute when the <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#spinbutton" rel="nofollow">spinbutton</a> has a value.</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">(-&gt;not <strong>MUST</strong>)</p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">Default for <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#aria-valuenow" rel="nofollow">aria-valuenow</a> is 0</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#option" rel="nofollow">https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#option</a></p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">Elements with the role option have an implicit <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#aria-selected" rel="nofollow">aria-selected</a> value of false.</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">Default for <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#aria-selected" rel="nofollow">aria-selected</a> is false.</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>



]]></content>
