<p dir="auto">This change addresses the dev-docs-needed requirement of <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1773681" rel="nofollow">Bug 1773681</a> Enable showing "Paste" button for <code class="notranslate">navigator.clipboard.readText()</code> when called from Addons which don't have <code class="notranslate">clipboardRead</code> permssion.</p>
<p dir="auto">The changes include:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
