<li>an update to the Interact with the clipboard article. In addition to aligning the documentation with this change, references to the deprecated <code class="notranslate">document.execCommand</code> methods were removed.</li>
<li>an update to the clipboard section on the Pesmissions page to remove references to the deprecated <code class="notranslate">document.execCommand</code> methods.</li>
<li>an update to the Clipboard API overview page's Security consideration section to align the documentation with this change.</li>
</ul>
