        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42239</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42239"/>
        <updated>2025-12-08T11:35:45.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100893747?u=5c736b1b891889a78840dca35835b9f488a45072&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This PR updates the </p><details> element documentation to reflect modern animation support.<br>
The outdated text claiming that transitions cannot be animated has been replaced with updated guidance referencing ::details-content, which enables smooth animations as part of Baseline since September 2025.<br>
Duplicate sentences were also removed for clarity.<p dir="auto"></p>
<p dir="auto">💡 Motivation</p>
<p dir="auto">Developers reading MDN were misled into believing that </p><details> cannot animate opens/closes.<br>
This change ensures the documentation is accurate and helps readers understand how to animate <details> widgets using the new pseudo-element.<p dir="auto"></p>
